R=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2];O=R/'exports/p3a_high_leverage_sensitivity_v1';load=lambda n:json.loads((O/n).read_text());s=load('summary.json');cases=load('first_failure_cases.json');events=load('all_failure_event_batches.json');refs=load('reference_noise_attribution.json');threshold=s['threshold'];present=[x for x in cases if x['suspect_present']];shams=[x for x in cases if x['sham_replace_ordinary']];ordinary=[z for x in present for z in x['replace_suspect']];shamrows=[z for x in shams for z in x['sham_replace_ordinary']];shares={m:np.array([x['methods'][m]['suspect_fraction'] for x in refs]) for m in ['cv1','cv2']};ratio=np.array([x['ratio_cv2_cv1'] for x in refs]);remaining=np.array([x['ratio_without_suspect_fixed_center'] for x in refs]);totalratio=sum(x['methods']['cv2']['noise_energy_total'] for x in refs)/sum(x['methods']['cv1']['noise_energy_total'] for x in refs);remainratio=sum(x['methods']['cv2']['energy_without_suspect_fixed_center'] for x in refs)/sum(x['methods']['cv1']['energy_without_suspect_fixed_center'] for x in refs)
text=['# P3A high-leverage sensitivity: observation29182','', '**结论：29182 是本轮 CV2 已观察失败的主要直接触发因素。固定输入替换测试提供了明确的单步机制证据；但尚未证明它解释全部 sampling accuracy 或 time-to-accuracy 差距。原始数据、posterior、协议成绩均未修改。**','', '## 全量失败事件核查','',f"- 原验证包含20个有失败的 runs、28个失败 replicas；本次直接重建全部28个首次失败时的 minibatch，{s['suspect_present_events']}/28包含29182。",f"- 20个 runs 各自首次失败完整重放均成功，{s['suspect_present_first_failures']}/20的触发 minibatch 包含29182。重放从首次失败前最后一个保存的 checkpoint 恢复，保留原512-lane计算形状和原RNG streams；三个既有重放案例的失败前状态再次核对一致。",'- 不同步长共享RNG。28个事件中有19个不同的(seed,lane,iteration)组合；它们不能视为28次独立试验，因此不计算二项检验或独立事件置信区间。','', '## 固定输入的单步干预','', '每个案例固定原始CV2失败前θ、h、P、anchor/Hessian correction及Gaussian noise，只改minibatch中的一条observation。16条替代来自预先冻结的普通leverage控制池，每次保持batch大小及无重复抽样。此干预不是正式sampler或新的无偏估计方法。','',f"- 对包含29182的{len(present)}个首次失败案例，共做{len(ordinary)}次普通observation替换；{sum(x['passes_single_step_radius_gate'] for x in ordinary)}/{len(ordinary)}次更新未越过失败半径。",f"- 其中batch>1的{len(shams)}个案例另做sham control：保留29182，替换同一batch中的普通observation。{sum(not x['passes_single_step_radius_gate'] for x in shamrows)}/{len(shamrows)}次仍越过失败半径。batch=1没有可用的第二条普通observation，无法做此sham。",'- 另做仅置零29182随机remainder向量的component ablation；该操作同样只用于归因，不能作为新的sampler结果。','', '|n|h|seed|首次失败iteration|含29182|原更新半径|替换29182后半径范围|通过/16|sham失败数|','|---|---|---|---:|---|---:|---|---:|---:|']
